branding/spots.tsv, the palettes and scripts/identity-file.sh with
scripts/lib-identity.sh are copied unchanged from artwork-template 353ef29
(the pinned ARTWORK_REF). scripts/make-out.sh writes a placeholder for every
file the render of the template makes for DragonFly (text instead of
images), scripts/identity-stamp.sh "stamps" by appending the identity to
the file, and scripts/render.sh is the source-checkout path. The suite makes
packs (scripts/pack.sh layout: PACK, out/, ...) from this tree.
